<title>LATVIA: Two Latvian yields down, one up at T-bill sale.</title>
<headline>Two Latvian yields down, one up at T-bill sale.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two out of three Treasury bill yields fell at auction on Wednesday, with only one-month paper showing a rise, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.  MATURITY    AV YLD	 LAST  NO OF BANKS    ISSUE  BID  SOLD</p>
<p> One-month    3.13	  3.10	 6	    0.5   1.35  0.5</p>
<p> Three-month  3.51	  3.74	 6	    0.7   1.75  0.7</p>
<p> Six-month    4.02	  4.37	 6	    2.0   4.59  2.0</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
